        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Bangkok/scene_zika.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 69d6aef8-3135-4fb3-b0ff-f04f2a18e348).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47, your targets are drug and weapon smuggllers Arthit Bursac and Thomas Spencer, the duo have recently been roped into the incredingly growning Liberation Cult and have begun to supply its leader, Oybek Nabazov, with some of their merchandise which they have smuggled in with the help of the militia.\r\rit is imperative for the client that both the targets and the drugs are taken care of, the drugs have been smuggled inside of a compartment designed by Spencer to hide the drugs inside of a Tuk-Tuk; we do not know where or how to find this compartment however, so the client has arranged for a stand-by mechanic to dismantle the vehicle once you drive it off-site.\r\rGood luck 47, I&#39;ll leave you to prepare.\r\n\r\nExit: Tuk-Tuk",
